，当人们身上的善念因为恶魔的引诱而被恶念渐渐压倒乃至消灭的时候，世上便又多了一个坏人。清元子叹道：“世上的善念越多，我就越年轻，世上的善念越少，我就越苍老，你们看我现在这个样子，就是因为世上的人们已经有很多坠入了邪神的掌中，邪神看我因为年迈而功力大减，便迫不及待的派人来杀我，想一举控制所有世界甚至整个时空。唐小虾你那晚梦见的两人，男的叫做红莲，是仇恨的象征，女的叫做金狐，是溺色的象征，他们都是邪神手下的七大护法之一，专门用他们的手段来毒害世人。“你说那男子是仇恨的象征么？还是什么七大护法之一，我看也不怎么样嘛，那次被我随便画下一条线，他就怎么都过不来！”唐小虾有些奇怪道：“难道我真的有特殊的能力？”“不错，不错。”清元子说：“你身上拥有火神的能力，不过那日却是因为你就在我身边，虽然我功力已衰，但还是用仅存的功力刺发出了你的能力，所以红莲才奈何你不得，但你的能力就像是火种，虽然有燃成烈焰冲天的能力，但燃料不足，也无计可施，我的能力越来越弱，能帮你的也有限了，在你功力大成之前，以后遇到他或是任何的邪神护法，都千万要躲起来。“那我怎么才能功力大成啊”！唐小虾听到还要练功，不禁无奈道。“呵呵，其实我也不知道。”清元子有些无奈的说，我是通过七彩玲珑石的指引才找到你的，而洛思琪的名字也是它驱动毛笔在丝帛上写下来的，当时红莲和金狐奉邪神之命四处追杀我，我不得已在进了你的梦中，没想到真的逼退了他们。“你不知道？”唐小虾一副觉得匪夷所思的样子，“那你怎么要我变得厉害击败他们呢！”清元子笑了，“天无绝人之路，七彩玲珑石既然选中了你们，冥冥中自有天意，也许时机到了，一切便会有答案吧！”洛思琪听清元子不断的在提七彩玲珑石，便问他：“您不断的提起七彩玲珑石，那究竟是个什么东西呢，对我们会有帮助么？”清元子点点头，只见他从袖口里拿出了一个紫色的木盒子，放在桌子上招呼洛思琪和唐小虾靠近些，轻轻的将它打开，洛思琪便看到了一串用银线串起来的石头，两人看着银线上那七颗小小的石头不禁有些目瞪口呆到眼珠子都要掉出来了。“这，这！”唐小虾因为吃惊说话居然有些口吃起来，也许他不是吃惊，而是因为觉得被耍而感到气愤，他对清元子说：“纯真小老头，你该不会是在耍我们的吧！你不是说什么七彩玲珑石么，怎么这上面的七个石头都是黑的？彩呢？彩在哪里？”洛思琪看到那七颗石头上面都有很好看的图案和花纹，不过因为是黑色的缘故，那上面的图案和花纹显得并不十分好看。她也满腹怀疑的看向清元子，等着他回答唐小虾问出的问题。清元子不再微笑，面色显得凝重起来，他站起来走到一个野鹿雕像面前轻轻把在鹿角上一放，鹿角上渐渐的发出了银色的光芒，只见屋子左上角的角落里，一块青石砖缓缓的移开了，清元子引两人过去，率先走下了洞口里露出的台阶，洛思琪和唐小虾两人对视了一眼，也跟着他走下去了。地下的台阶尽头是一段长长的甬道，甬道的四壁都是用青石做成的，上面还雕刻着许多山水和人物的画作，洛思琪见见上面的景色都雕刻的非常恢弘大气，完全不同于她之前见过的地方。清元子解释给她说：“这上面雕刻的都是上古时的神灵和人类中的佼佼者，盘古开天辟地后，山河多难，人们难以生存，幸喜他们之中有很少一部分人不知为何拥有了通神的能力，他们能在关键时刻取得神灵的垂青，获得他们的能力，这些能力虽不能像盘古那样改天换地，但也一次又一次的让他们护佑族人们化险为夷。随着大禹治水之后，灾难渐渐的少了下来，历经夏商周三朝代之后，人类在这片土地上活得日渐安稳，大自然对他们的威胁越来越小，但随之而来的便是私欲之心日起，上从大禹的儿子夏启废除禅让自立为王，下到你们曾经生活的时代人们明里暗里恶斗不息，这上面雕刻的便是从古至今的许多故事！”果然洛思琪越往后走渐渐开始有了一种熟悉的感觉，她开始看到齐桓公称霸大集诸侯的场景，也有唐太宗宣武门之变的画面，越往后走便离现代越近，她甚至看到了华夏儿女奋起抗日的场景，直到最后一幅画面，画上只有数不清的高楼和楼下川流不息的汽车，人们都形色匆匆，表情各异，但没有一个人脸上有一丝笑容。洛思琪在这副画前站住了，心中十分不是滋味，她转头对清元子说：“纯真，这副画上所画的，便是人类最后的结局么？”清元子摇了摇头，一指旁边还有大约十米的空白墙壁，对洛思琪说：“我也不知道这面墙壁上最终画的会是什么，也许这就要看你们了！”“我们？”在洛思琪的不解中，清元子打开了十米外的一道石门，随着石门缓缓开启，洛思琪和唐小虾随着清元子进入了一个类似于溶洞的世界。溶洞中有一条小河从溶洞的远处缓缓流向这边，没入身后一块石头下不见了。清元子指着这条小河说：“这条小河便是你们在外面见到的那条小河的源头。”三个人向溶洞里又走了几十步，洛思琪看见小河在溶洞中形成了一个小湖泊，这湖泊长宽都不过十几米，中心还有一个长宽不到三米的小平台，平台的一头有一道简陋的石桥通向湖边，上面立着一个底座平平上面尖尖的小石碑。这小石碑全身青色，发出了淡淡的青绿色的光，清元子招呼两人跟他通过石桥走到石碑前，洛思琪看到石碑上都是一些很精美但看不出其中深意的花纹，她觉得这些花纹有些熟悉，似乎从哪里见过。恍然间才突然醒悟，指着上面的花纹对另两人道：“这，这上面的花纹和那七个黑石头上的花纹一模一样！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/laidaochunqiudangyueshen/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4 Colorful Exquisite Stone Qing Yuanzi heard Tang Xiaoxia say this and couldn't help but touch his white beard with his hand and said with a smile: \"My child, you don't have to be too impatient, just listen to me and tell you bit by bit.\" It turns out that the reason why Qing Yuanzi was called innocent by those two people was actually related to his birth. He is not a mortal, but a collection of innocent and good thoughts in the hearts of all living beings in the world. He was originally innocent when he was born, but as he grew up little by little, the evil god sent his minions to transform into bad guys, luring people little by little into various bad habits. When the good thoughts in people are gradually overwhelmed or even eliminated by evil thoughts due to the temptation of the devil, there is another bad person in the world. Qing Yuanzi sighed: \"The more good thoughts in the world, the younger I am; the less good thoughts in the world, the older I am. You see me like this now because many people in the world have fallen into the hands of the evil god. The evil god saw that my skills were greatly reduced due to old age, so he couldn't wait to send people to kill me. Think about it. Control all the worlds and even the entire time and space. The two people you dreamed about that night, Tang Xiaoxia, the male is called Red Lotus, which is a symbol of hatred, and the female is called Golden Fox, which is a symbol of lust. They are both one of the seven guardians of the evil god, and they specialize in poisoning the world with their methods. \"Do you think that man is a symbol of hatred? He's still one of the seven guardians, and I don't think he's that good at all. That time I drew a line casually, and he couldn't get over it no matter what! Tang Xiaoxia said a little strangely: \"Do I really have special abilities?\" \"Not bad, not bad.\" \"Qing Yuanzi said: \"You have the ability of the God of Fire, but it was because you were by my side that day. Although my skill has declined, I still used the remaining skill to stimulate your ability. That's why Honglian can't do anything to you, but your ability is like Although the fire has the ability to ignite into flames and soar into the sky, there is insufficient fuel and there is nothing I can do. My ability is getting weaker and weaker, and I am limited in what I can do to help you. Before you achieve great power, you must hide when you encounter him or any evil god protector in the future. \"Then how can I achieve great success?\" Tang Xiaoxia couldn't help but said helplessly when he heard that he still wanted to practice. \"Haha, actually I don't know either.\" Qing Yuanzi said with some helplessness, I found you through the guidance of the colorful exquisite stone, and Luo Siqi's name was also written on the silk by it driving the brush. At that time, Honglian and Jinhu were chasing me everywhere under the orders of the evil god. I had no choice but to enter your dream, but I didn't expect to really force them back. \"You don't know?\" Tang Xiaoxia looked puzzled, \"Then why do you want me to become powerful and defeat them!\" Qing Yuanzi smiled, \"There is no end to the road. Since the colorful exquisite stone has chosen you, there is God's will. Maybe when the time comes, everything will have the answer!\" Luo Siqi heard Yuanzi keep mentioning the colorful exquisite stone, and asked him: \"You keep mentioning the colorful exquisite stone. \"What on earth is that, and will it be helpful to us?\" Qing Yuanzi nodded, and he took out a purple wooden box from his cuff, put it on the table and asked Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia to come closer, and opened it gently. Luo Siqi saw a string of stones strung with silver wires. The two of them were so stunned that their eyes almost fell out when they looked at the seven small stones on the silver strings. \"This, this!\" Tang Xiaoxia stuttered because he was surprised. Maybe he was not surprised, but angry because he felt that he was being played. He said to Qing Yuanzi: \"Innocent little old man, you are not playing tricks on us, are you? Didn't you say something about Colorful Ling?\" \"Longshi, why are the seven stones above all black? Where is the color?\" Luo Siqi saw that the seven stones had beautiful patterns and patterns on them, but because they were black, the patterns and patterns on them were not very beautiful. She also looked at Qing Yuanzi with suspicion, waiting for him to answer Tang Xiaoxia's question. Qing Yuanzi stopped smiling and his face became serious. He stood up and walked to a wild deer statue and gently put it on the antlers. The antlers gradually glowed with silver. In the upper left corner of the room, a bluestone brick slowly moved away. Qing Yuanzi led the two of them over and took the lead to go down the steps exposed at the entrance of the cave. Luo Siqi and Tang Xiaoxia looked at each other and followed him down. At the end of the underground steps was a long corridor. The four walls of the corridor were made of bluestone, and there were many paintings of landscapes and people carved on it. Luo Siqi saw that the scenery above was very majestic, completely different from the places she had seen before. Qing Yuanzi explained to her: \"The carvings here are all the gods and the best among humans in ancient times. After the creation of the world, the mountains and rivers were in trouble and it was difficult for people to survive. Fortunately, a small number of them had the ability to communicate with the gods for some reason, and they were able to win the favor of the gods at critical moments. , obtain their abilities. Although these abilities cannot change the world like Pangu, they have allowed them to protect the people and save the people time and time again. After Dayu controlled the floods, the disasters gradually decreased. After the Xia, Shang and Zhou dynasties, human beings lived increasingly stably on this land, and nature continued. The threat to them is getting smaller and smaller, but what follows is selfish desire. From the time when Xia Qi, the son of Dayu, abolished the abdication and proclaimed himself king, down to the time you lived in, people fought openly and secretly. What is engraved on it are many stories from ancient times to the present!\" As expected, Luo Siqi walked back and forth! Gradually, she began to have a familiar feeling. She began to see the scene of Duke Huan of Qi dominating the princes, and the scene of the Xuanwumen incident of Emperor Taizong of the Tang Dynasty. The further back she went, the closer she got to modern times. She even saw the scene of the Chinese people rising up to resist the Japanese. Until the last scene, there were only countless tall buildings and buildings.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}